{% comment %}
  Home-Gym-Konfigurator mit Mo — Men's Health / Women's Health cooperation.

  The landing page of the cooperation: hero with the partner seals, the
  configurator (left, ≤ 50 %) and Mo docked next to it (right) under the
  five-step timeline. The visitor picks a few basics („Welcher Typ bist du? /
  Trainingsort & Platz / Training & Niveau“), „Weiter“ opens the optional step
  04 („Gibt es etwas, das wir in deinem Fall beachten sollten?“ — a free-text
  note of ≤ 500 characters), „Weiter – Mo berät mich“ (or „Überspringen“)
  hands everything to Mo (window.MS_CHAT.configurator.start of
  ms-chat-widget.js; the note travels as answers.note). Mo asks for budget and
  wishes with answer chips, then offers the equipment step by step; every
  pick lands in the editable plan on the left (dark blue box) with one „Alles
  in den Warenkorb“.

  Look: the backend's „Performance“ e-mail design (mo repo,
  src/lib/email-designs/performance.ts) — light-blue accent, bordered white
  cards — with the store's homepage structure: sections alternate
  #ffffff / #f9f9f9, headings as a blue kicker over a regular-weight headline
  („Darf in keinem Gym fehlen. / Bestseller.“), no divider lines, and the
  homepage's pill buttons („MOTION SPORTS – Learn more“: black, blue on
  hover; no red anywhere). With a hero image (setting hero_image, focal point
  from the theme editor) the hero is a dark image banner with the copy on the
  left and the seal block (both seals side by side, the sentence centred
  under them, no panel — as in the client's picture) inside it at the top
  right — or bottom right (setting seal_position); the photo is placed so
  that its focal point sits between the copy and the seal block. Without an
  image the hero stays white. The answer cards carry the step badges
  SCHRITT 01–04. The shared --hgk-* tokens are defined on .ms-hgk
  (…configurator.css); --hgk-navy (the „SCHRITT 03“ blue) is the plan box.

  Hosts the widget fills (contract in ms-chat-widget.js → Home-Gym-Konfigurator):
    [data-ms-chat-dock]  the docked chat panel (intro below until the handover)
    [data-ms-chat-plan]  the editable plan (data-state: empty | waiting | ready)
  Page logic: assets/ms-home-gym-configurator.js, styles: …configurator.css.
  Answer ids are the backend's vocabulary (mo repo, src/lib/configurator-core.mjs);
  the personas are Mo's own customer personas.

  „Weiter“ stays clickable while answers are open; a click outlines the cards
  with open answers in the error colour, names the field („Bitte wähle deine
  Fläche aus.“) and moves to the first one. The
  Konfigurator-Rabatt (pop-up + banner above the plan) comes entirely from the
  Mo backend (admin: Konfigurator → „Mo im Konfigurator“, off by default;
  GET /api/configurator/offer) and is built by the page JS — no section setting,
  no markup without an offer.

  Promotional links can preselect answers and the partner:
    ?partner=mh|wh  (or utm_source containing menshealth / womenshealth)
    ?persona=strength_focused&location=house&space=xs&level=rookie&training=free_weights,cardio
    (persona aliases typ/type/fokus/focus/target/ziel; level aliases skills/niveau;
     ort → location, platz → space; a value may also be the option's position,
     e.g. target=01 = the first persona; old persona/goal ids still map)
{% endcomment %}

{{ 'ms-home-gym-configurator.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

{%- liquid
  assign hgk_en = false
  if request.locale.iso_code == 'en'
    assign hgk_en = true
  endif
  assign hgk_mo_on = false
  if settings.ai_advisor_enabled and settings.ms_chat_shared_secret != blank
    assign hgk_mo_on = true
  endif
  assign hgk_seals = false
  if section.settings.seal_mh != blank or section.settings.seal_wh != blank
    assign hgk_seals = true
  endif
  assign hgk_fallback = section.settings.fallback_url | default: '/pages/angebotsanfrage'
  assign hgk_img = section.settings.hero_image
  assign hgk_has_img = false
  if hgk_img != blank
    assign hgk_has_img = true
  endif
  assign hgk_seal_bottom = false
  if hgk_seals and section.settings.seal_position == 'bottom'
    assign hgk_seal_bottom = true
  endif
  assign hgk_focal_x = hgk_img.presentation.focal_point.x | default: 50
  assign hgk_img_ar = hgk_img.aspect_ratio | default: 1.7778
-%}

{%- capture hgk_hero_copy -%}
  <div class="ms-hgk-hero__copy">
    {%- if section.settings.hero_intro != blank -%}
      <p class="ms-hgk-kicker ms-hgk-hero__intro{% if section.settings.hero_intro_caps %} ms-hgk-kicker--caps{% endif %}">{{ section.settings.hero_intro | escape | replace: ' – ', '&nbsp;– ' | newline_to_br }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}
    <h1 class="ms-hgk-hero__title">{{ section.settings.heading | escape }}</h1>
    <div class="ms-hgk-hero__actions">
      <a class="ms-hgk-btn ms-hgk-btn--primary ms-hgk-hero__cta" href="#ms-hgk-start-{{ section.id }}" data-ms-hgk-scroll>
        <span>{{ section.settings.hero_cta | default: 'Jetzt Home Gym planen' | escape }}</span>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12l7 7 7-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- comment -%}
  The seal block, as in the client's picture: both seals side by side
  (Men's Health first, as everywhere else on the site), the sentence centred
  under the pair — no panel (white text on the photo, dark on white).
  sizes = the seal width in …configurator.css (--hgk-seal): ≤ 256 px from
  1200 px (on the photo 10.65 % of the hero, ≤ 230 px), ≤ 200 px from
  750 px, ~41 % of the screen on phones.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture hgk_hero_seals -%}
  {%- if hgk_seals -%}
    <div class="ms-hgk-sealbox{% if section.settings.seal_note == blank %} ms-hgk-sealbox--bare{% endif %}">
      <div class="ms-hgk-seals__row ms-hgk-sealbox__row">
        {%- if section.settings.seal_mh != blank -%}
          <div class="ms-hgk-seal" data-partner-seal="mh">
            {{ section.settings.seal_mh | image_url: width: 600 | image_tag: loading: 'eager', alt: section.settings.seal_mh_alt, widths: '300, 450, 600', sizes: '(min-width: 1200px) 256px, (min-width: 750px) 200px, 45vw' }}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if section.settings.seal_wh != blank -%}
          <div class="ms-hgk-seal" data-partner-seal="wh">
            {{ section.settings.seal_wh | image_url: width: 600 | image_tag: loading: 'eager', alt: section.settings.seal_wh_alt, widths: '300, 450, 600', sizes: '(min-width: 1200px) 256px, (min-width: 750px) 200px, 45vw' }}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
      {%- if section.settings.seal_note != blank -%}
        <p class="ms-hgk-sealbox__note">{{ section.settings.seal_note | escape }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endcapture -%}

<section
  class="ms-hgk"
  id="ms-hgk-{{ section.id }}"
  data-ms-hgk
  data-locale="{% if hgk_en %}en{% else %}de{% endif %}"
  data-partner="{{ section.settings.partner }}"
  data-mo="{% if hgk_mo_on %}on{% else %}off{% endif %}"
  data-fallback-url="{{ hgk_fallback }}"
>
  {%- comment -%}
    ---------- Hero ----------
    With an image: a dark banner — the copy on the left over a gradient, the
    seal block inside the banner at the top right (seal_position „Unten
    rechts“: bottom right; one modifier class, ms-hgk-hero--seals-bottom) and
    the photo, at its own aspect ratio and the full banner height, placed so
    that its focal point (theme editor) lands between the copy and the seal
    block: the rack stays visible. Up to 1199 px the seal block stands under
    the copy and the photo fills the room to the right. Phones: the photo on
    top (16:10, focal point), the copy and the seal block below on white.
    Without an image: white hero, copy left, seal block right (from 1200 px)
    or below.
    sizes = the width the photo is drawn at (…configurator.css): its height ×
    its aspect ratio — 1085 px from 1600 px, 1030 px at 1440, ≤ 1100 px from
    750 px; phones: the 16:10 box crops a 16:9 photo to 111 % of the screen.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="ms-hgk-hero{% if hgk_has_img %} ms-hgk-hero--image{% endif %}{% if hgk_seals %} ms-hgk-hero--seals{% endif %}{% if hgk_seal_bottom %} ms-hgk-hero--seals-bottom{% endif %}{% if hgk_seals and section.settings.seal_trim > 0 %} ms-hgk-hero--seal-trim" style="--hgk-seal-trim: {{ section.settings.seal_trim | divided_by: 100.0 }};{% endif %}">
    {%- if hgk_has_img -%}
      <div class="ms-hgk-hero__banner">
        <div class="ms-hgk-hero__media" style="--hgk-focal: {{ hgk_img.presentation.focal_point }}; --hgk-focal-x: {{ hgk_focal_x }}; --hgk-img-ar: {{ hgk_img_ar }};">
          {{ hgk_img | image_url: width: 2400 | image_tag: loading: 'eager', fetchpriority: 'high', widths: '750, 1100, 1500, 1800, 2400', sizes: '(min-width: 750px) 1100px, 112vw', alt: hgk_img.alt, class: 'ms-hgk-hero__img' }}
        </div>
        <div class="ms-hgk-wrap ms-hgk-hero__inner">
          {{ hgk_hero_copy }}
          {{ hgk_hero_seals }}
        </div>
      </div>
    {%- else -%}
      <div class="ms-hgk-wrap ms-hgk-hero__inner">
        {{ hgk_hero_copy }}
        {{ hgk_hero_seals }}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} Small seals for the header of the „Welcher Typ bist du?“ card (cloned by the page JS). {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if hgk_seals -%}
    <template data-ms-hgk-seals-small>
      {%- if section.settings.seal_mh != blank -%}
        <span class="ms-hgk-miniseal" data-partner-seal="mh">{{ section.settings.seal_mh | image_url: width: 160 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.seal_mh_alt, widths: '80, 160', sizes: '64px' }}</span>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if section.settings.seal_wh != blank -%}
        <span class="ms-hgk-miniseal" data-partner-seal="wh">{{ section.settings.seal_wh | image_url: width: 160 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.seal_wh_alt, widths: '80, 160', sizes: '64px' }}</span>
      {%- endif -%}
    </template>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- comment -%}
    ---------- Configurator stage ----------
    The timeline (five steps, page stages start → notes → questions → plan →
    cart) sits in its own card above Mo — same edges as the chat; timeline and
    chat stick together under the header (…configurator.css: .ms-hgk-side).
    Up to 989 px (one column) it is the first thing of the configurator.
    Step 04 (the note) is built by the page JS after card 03; „Überspringen“
    hands over without a note.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="ms-hgk-stage" id="ms-hgk-start-{{ section.id }}">
    <div class="ms-hgk-wrap">
      <div class="ms-hgk-grid">
        <div class="ms-hgk-left">
          <form class="ms-hgk-form" data-ms-hgk-form novalidate>
            <div class="ms-hgk-form__groups" data-ms-hgk-groups>
              <noscript><p class="ms-hgk-note">{% if hgk_en %}Please enable JavaScript to use the configurator.{% else %}Bitte aktiviere JavaScript, um den Konfigurator zu nutzen.{% endif %}</p></noscript>
            </div>
            <div class="ms-hgk-form__footer">
              <p class="ms-hgk-form__hint" data-ms-hgk-hint aria-live="polite"></p>
              <div class="ms-hgk-form__actions">
                <button type="submit" class="ms-hgk-btn ms-hgk-btn--primary ms-hgk-cta" data-ms-hgk-cta disabled>
                  <span data-ms-hgk-cta-label>{% if hgk_en %}Continue{% else %}Weiter{% endif %}</span>
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
                </button>
                <button type="button" class="ms-hgk-btn ms-hgk-btn--secondary ms-hgk-skip" data-ms-hgk-skip hidden>{% if hgk_en %}Skip{% else %}Überspringen{% endif %}</button>
              </div>
              <button type="button" class="ms-hgk-link" data-ms-hgk-cancel hidden>{% if hgk_en %}Cancel{% else %}Abbrechen{% endif %}</button>
            </div>
          </form>

          <div class="ms-hgk-profile" data-ms-hgk-profile hidden>
            <div class="ms-hgk-profile__head">
              <p class="ms-hgk-profile__title">{% if hgk_en %}Your answers{% else %}Deine Angaben{% endif %}</p>
              <div class="ms-hgk-profile__actions">
                <button type="button" class="ms-hgk-btn ms-hgk-btn--secondary ms-hgk-btn--sm" data-ms-hgk-edit>{% if hgk_en %}Change{% else %}Ändern{% endif %}</button>
                <button type="button" class="ms-hgk-btn ms-hgk-btn--secondary ms-hgk-btn--sm ms-hgk-btn--quiet" data-ms-hgk-restart>{% if hgk_en %}Start over{% else %}Neu starten{% endif %}</button>
              </div>
            </div>
            <ul class="ms-hgk-chips" data-ms-hgk-chips role="list"></ul>
          </div>

          <div class="ms-hgk-plan" data-ms-chat-plan data-state="empty">
            <div class="ms-hgk-plan__waiting">
              <span class="ms-hgk-plan__pulse" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <div>
                <p class="ms-hgk-plan__title">{% if hgk_en %}Your home-gym plan{% else %}Dein Home-Gym-Plan{% endif %}</p>
                <p class="ms-hgk-plan__text">{% if hgk_en %}Choose your equipment with Mo step by step&nbsp;– your plan comes together right&nbsp;here.{% else %}Wähle bei Mo Schritt für Schritt deine Geräte aus&nbsp;– dein Plan entsteht genau&nbsp;hier.{% endif %}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="ms-hgk-right">
          <div class="ms-hgk-side" data-ms-hgk-side>
            <div class="ms-hgk-timeline">
              <ol class="ms-hgk-steps" data-ms-hgk-steps aria-label="{% if hgk_en %}Progress{% else %}Fortschritt{% endif %}">
                <li class="ms-hgk-steps__item is-current" data-step="start"><span class="ms-hgk-steps__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="ms-hgk-steps__label">{% if hgk_en %}Basics{% else %}Grundeinstellungen{% endif %}</span></li>
                <li class="ms-hgk-steps__item" data-step="notes"><span class="ms-hgk-steps__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="ms-hgk-steps__label">{% if hgk_en %}Your notes{% else %}Deine Hinweise{% endif %}</span></li>
                <li class="ms-hgk-steps__item" data-step="questions"><span class="ms-hgk-steps__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="ms-hgk-steps__label">{% if hgk_en %}Advice from Mo{% else %}Beratung mit Mo{% endif %}</span></li>
                <li class="ms-hgk-steps__item" data-step="plan"><span class="ms-hgk-steps__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="ms-hgk-steps__label">{% if hgk_en %}Your plan{% else %}Dein Plan{% endif %}</span></li>
                <li class="ms-hgk-steps__item" data-step="cart"><span class="ms-hgk-steps__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="ms-hgk-steps__label">{% if hgk_en %}Cart{% else %}Warenkorb{% endif %}</span></li>
              </ol>
            </div>
            <div class="ms-hgk-dock" data-ms-chat-dock>
              <div class="ms-hgk-intro" data-ms-hgk-intro>
                <span class="ms-chat-logo ms-hgk-intro__orb" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <p class="ms-hgk-intro__title">{{ section.settings.mo_hello | escape }}</p>
                {%- if section.settings.mo_lead != blank -%}
                  <p class="ms-hgk-intro__text">{{ section.settings.mo_lead | escape }}</p>
                {%- endif -%}
                <p class="ms-hgk-intro__hint" data-ms-hgk-intro-hint>
                  <span class="ms-hgk-intro__hint-wide">{% if hgk_en %}← Pick your basics on the left{% else %}← Wähle links deine Grundeinstellungen{% endif %}</span>
                  <span class="ms-hgk-intro__hint-narrow">{% if hgk_en %}↑ Pick your basics above{% else %}↑ Wähle oben deine Grundeinstellungen{% endif %}</span>
                </p>
                <p class="ms-hgk-intro__fallback" data-ms-hgk-fallback hidden>
                  {%- if hgk_en -%}Mo is not available right now.{%- else -%}Mo ist gerade nicht erreichbar.{%- endif %}
                  <a href="{{ hgk_fallback }}">{% if hgk_en %}Ask our team instead{% else %}Frag stattdessen unser Team{% endif %}</a>
                </p>
                <p class="ms-hgk-intro__legal">{% if hgk_en %}AI home-gym advisor · free and without obligation{% else %}KI-Home-Gym-Berater · kostenlos &amp; unverbindlich{% endif %}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} ---------- How it works ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="ms-hgk-how" id="ms-hgk-how-{{ section.id }}">
    <div class="ms-hgk-wrap">
      <div class="ms-hgk-head">
        <p class="ms-hgk-kicker ms-hgk-kicker--caps">{% if hgk_en %}How it works{% else %}So funktioniert’s{% endif %}</p>
        <h2 class="ms-hgk-display">{% if hgk_en %}Your home gym in three steps.{% else %}In drei Schritten zu deinem Home Gym.{% endif %}</h2>
      </div>
      <ol class="ms-hgk-how__list" role="list">
        <li>
          <span class="ms-hgk-how__num">1</span>
          <p class="ms-hgk-how__title">{% if hgk_en %}Pick your basics{% else %}Grundeinstellungen wählen{% endif %}</p>
          <p class="ms-hgk-how__text">{% if hgk_en %}Your training focus, place, space and level – a few clicks.{% else %}Dein Trainingsfokus, Ort, Platz und Niveau – ein paar Klicks.{% endif %}</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="ms-hgk-how__num">2</span>
          <p class="ms-hgk-how__title">{% if hgk_en %}Talk to Mo{% else %}Mit Mo sprechen{% endif %}</p>
          <p class="ms-hgk-how__text">{% if hgk_en %}Mo asks about budget and wishes – tap an answer or write freely.{% else %}Mo fragt nach Budget und Wünschen – Antwort antippen oder frei schreiben.{% endif %}</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="ms-hgk-how__num">3</span>
          <p class="ms-hgk-how__title">{% if hgk_en %}Get your plan{% else %}Plan bekommen{% endif %}</p>
          <p class="ms-hgk-how__text">{% if hgk_en %}Mo presents matching equipment step by step – you choose, everything goes into your plan and into the cart with one click.{% else %}Mo stellt dir Schritt für Schritt passende Geräte vor – du wählst aus, alles landet in deinem Plan und mit einem Klick im Warenkorb.{% endif %}</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} ---------- Partners ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if section.settings.coop_heading != blank or section.settings.partners_copy != blank -%}
    <div class="ms-hgk-coop">
      <div class="ms-hgk-wrap">
        <div class="ms-hgk-coop__inner{% if hgk_seals %} ms-hgk-coop__inner--seals{% endif %}">
          {%- if hgk_seals -%}
            <div class="ms-hgk-coop__seals ms-hgk-seals__row">
              {%- if section.settings.seal_mh != blank -%}
                <div class="ms-hgk-seal ms-hgk-seal--lg" data-partner-seal="mh">{{ section.settings.seal_mh | image_url: width: 600 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.seal_mh_alt, widths: '300, 450, 600', sizes: '(min-width: 990px) 280px, 180px' }}</div>
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- if section.settings.seal_wh != blank -%}
                <div class="ms-hgk-seal ms-hgk-seal--lg" data-partner-seal="wh">{{ section.settings.seal_wh | image_url: width: 600 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.seal_wh_alt, widths: '300, 450, 600', sizes: '(min-width: 990px) 280px, 180px' }}</div>
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
          <div class="ms-hgk-coop__copy">
            {%- if section.settings.partners_label != blank -%}<p class="ms-hgk-kicker ms-hgk-kicker--caps">{{ section.settings.partners_label | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
            {%- if section.settings.coop_heading != blank -%}<h2 class="ms-hgk-display">{{ section.settings.coop_heading | escape }}</h2>{%- endif -%}
            {%- if section.settings.partners_copy != blank -%}<div class="ms-hgk-coop__text">{{ section.settings.partners_copy }}</div>{%- endif -%}
            {%- if section.settings.coop_link != blank and section.settings.coop_link_label != blank -%}
              <a class="ms-hgk-btn ms-hgk-btn--secondary" href="{{ section.settings.coop_link }}">{{ section.settings.coop_link_label | escape }}</a>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}
</section>

<script src="{{ 'ms-home-gym-configurator.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Home-Gym-Konfigurator",
  "tag": "div",
  "class": "section-ms-hgk",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Konfigurator mit Mo: links die Grundeinstellungen (Typ, Ort & Platz, Training & Niveau), rechts berät Mo und stellt den Home-Gym-Plan zusammen. Mo nutzt dafür das Konfigurator-Sortiment (Shopify-Tag „home-gym-konfigurator“, einstellbar im Mo-Backend unter Konfigurator). Mo muss unter Theme-Einstellungen → AI Advisor aktiv sein."
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "partner",
      "label": "Partner dieser Landingpage",
      "info": "Wird in den Kennzahlen als Herkunft gezählt und setzt das Siegel des Partners nach vorn. Ein Link mit ?partner=mh oder ?partner=wh überschreibt die Einstellung.",
      "options": [
        { "value": "none", "label": "Beide / keiner" },
        { "value": "mh", "label": "Men's Health" },
        { "value": "wh", "label": "Women's Health" }
      ],
      "default": "none"
    },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Kopfbereich" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "hero_intro", "label": "Einleitung über der Überschrift", "default": "In wenigen Schritten dein Home Gym konfigurieren – mit persönlicher KI-Beratung von Mo." },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "hero_intro_caps", "label": "Einleitung in Großbuchstaben", "info": "Wie die blauen Zeilen auf der Startseite („DARF IN KEINEM GYM FEHLEN.“) – bei einem langen Satz meist ruhiger ohne.", "default": false },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Überschrift", "info": "Ab Tablet-Breite einzeilig – kurz halten.", "default": "Dein Home Gym. Klar geplant." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "hero_cta", "label": "Button", "default": "Jetzt Home Gym planen" },
